{# Mira interview shows — booking confirmation (show fields injected by render_email(show=...)). Live send is the Worker's inline copy
   (cal-com-booked handler); keep in sync if you edit tone. #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <h2 style="color:{{ brand_color }}">You're booked</h2>
  <p>Hi {{ guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Your {{ show_name }} interview is set for <strong>{{ scheduled_at }}</strong>.
  You'll join from your personal browser studio —
  <a href="{{ studio_url }}">bookmark your studio link</a>
  — from a computer in a quiet room, ideally with headphones or AirPods
  (camera optional but appreciated). The day before, you'll receive a
  short prep brief with the themes she plans to explore.</p>
  <p>The call is recorded, and nothing publishes until you've reviewed and
  approved the transcript.</p>
  <p>{{ sign_off }}</p>
</div>
